WEBVTT

00:00:00.704 --> 00:00:02.358
You are...

00:00:02.489 --> 00:00:03.969
...Po.

00:00:52.669 --> 00:00:56.238
Behold the Dragon Scroll.

00:00:56.369 --> 00:00:58.066
It is yours.

00:00:58.197 --> 00:01:01.243
Wait. What happens
when I read it?

00:01:01.374 --> 00:01:05.421
No one knows. But legend says
you will be able to hear
a butterfly's wing beat.

00:01:05.552 --> 00:01:07.684
Whoa. Really? That's cool.

00:01:07.815 --> 00:01:10.644
Yes. And see light
in the deepest cave.

00:01:10.774 --> 00:01:13.516
You will feel the universe
in motion around you.

00:01:13.647 --> 00:01:15.518
Wow! Can I
punch through walls?

00:01:15.649 --> 00:01:17.869
- Do a quadruple back flip?
- Focus.

00:01:17.999 --> 00:01:19.435
- Will I have...?
- Focus.

00:01:19.566 --> 00:01:21.133
- Focus.
- Oh, yeah, yeah.

00:01:21.263 --> 00:01:22.308
Read it, Po,

00:01:22.438 --> 00:01:24.049
and fulfill your destiny.

00:01:24.179 --> 00:01:26.399
Read it and become...

00:01:26.529 --> 00:01:28.183
...the Dragon Warrior.

00:01:28.314 --> 00:01:29.881
Whoa!

00:01:32.884 --> 00:01:35.060
[straining]

00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:36.365
It's impossible to open.

00:01:36.496 --> 00:01:41.283
OK. Come on, baby.
Come on now.

00:01:41.414 --> 00:01:44.417
- [top pops]
- Thank you.

00:01:44.547 --> 00:01:46.985
I probably loosened it up
for you though.

00:01:47.115 --> 00:01:50.075
[clears throat]
OK, here goes.

00:01:54.949 --> 00:01:59.040
- [screaming]
- [all gasp]

00:02:01.869 --> 00:02:03.523
- It's blank.
- What?!

00:02:03.653 --> 00:02:04.828
Here, look.

00:02:04.959 --> 00:02:07.092
No, I am forbidden
to look upon...

00:02:13.054 --> 00:02:15.883
Blank. I don't...

00:02:16.014 --> 00:02:18.277
I don't understand.

00:02:19.495 --> 00:02:21.933
OK. So, like...

00:02:22.063 --> 00:02:25.414
...Oogway was just
a crazy old turtle after all.

00:02:25.545 --> 00:02:28.113
No. Oogway was wiser
than us all.

00:02:28.243 --> 00:02:32.334
Oh, come on! Face it,
he picked me by accident.

00:02:32.465 --> 00:02:36.469
Of course I'm not the Dragon
Warrior. Who am I kidding?

00:02:36.599 --> 00:02:39.167
[Tigress]
But who will stop Tai Lung?

00:02:39.298 --> 00:02:41.648
[Crane] He'll destroy
everything and everyone.

00:02:41.778 --> 00:02:43.737
No.

00:02:43.867 --> 00:02:45.608
Evacuate the valley.

00:02:45.739 --> 00:02:49.134
You must protect the villagers
from Tai Lung's rage.

00:02:49.264 --> 00:02:51.788
- What about you, Master?
- I will fight him.

00:02:51.919 --> 00:02:54.530
- What?
- I can hold him off long enough

00:02:54.661 --> 00:02:58.534
- for everyone to escape.
- But, Shifu, he'll kill you.

00:02:58.665 --> 00:03:01.407
Then I will finally have paid
for my mistake.

00:03:01.537 --> 00:03:04.627
Listen to me, all of you.

00:03:04.758 --> 00:03:07.935
It is time for you to continue
your journey without me.

00:03:08.066 --> 00:03:11.417
I am very proud
to have been your master.

00:03:32.046 --> 00:03:34.222
We've got to
get them out safely.

00:03:34.353 --> 00:03:36.746
Come, little one.
Let's find your mama.

00:03:36.877 --> 00:03:40.402
Viper, gather the southern
farmers. Mantis, the north.

00:03:40.533 --> 00:03:42.361
Crane, light the way.

00:04:01.293 --> 00:04:04.470
Look, it's the
Dragon Warrior.

00:04:09.257 --> 00:04:11.085
[exhaling deeply]

00:04:13.087 --> 00:04:14.871
Hey, Dad.

00:04:15.002 --> 00:04:16.482
Po!

00:04:22.270 --> 00:04:24.490
Good to have you back, son.

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:28.189
Good to be back.

00:04:28.320 --> 00:04:30.148
Let's go, Po.

00:04:32.498 --> 00:04:35.327
So for our next shop,
it's time to face it...

00:04:35.457 --> 00:04:39.244
...the future of noodles
is dice-cut vegetables...

00:04:39.374 --> 00:04:41.333
...no longer slices.

00:04:41.463 --> 00:04:44.814
Also, I was thinking,
maybe this time

00:04:44.945 --> 00:04:48.427
we'll have a kitchen
you can actually stand up in.

00:04:49.645 --> 00:04:50.951
You like that?

00:04:56.870 --> 00:05:01.483
Po, I'm sorry
if things didn't work out.

00:05:01.614 --> 00:05:04.791
It just
wasn't meant to be.

00:05:08.099 --> 00:05:10.492
Po, forget everything else.

00:05:10.623 --> 00:05:12.755
Your destiny still awaits.

00:05:12.886 --> 00:05:17.717
We are noodle folk. Broth runs
deep through our veins.

00:05:17.847 --> 00:05:20.111
I don't know, Dad.

00:05:20.241 --> 00:05:24.289
Honestly, sometimes I can't
believe I'm actually your son.

00:05:25.855 --> 00:05:28.467
[chuckles] Po...

00:05:28.597 --> 00:05:32.993
...I think it's time
I told you something
I should have told you...

00:05:33.124 --> 00:05:37.084
- ...a long time ago.
- OK.

00:05:38.651 --> 00:05:42.568
The secret ingredient
of my Secret Ingredient Soup.

00:05:42.698 --> 00:05:45.092
Oh.

00:05:45.223 --> 00:05:49.836
Come here.
The secret ingredient is...

00:05:49.966 --> 00:05:52.404
- ...nothing.
- Huh?

00:05:52.534 --> 00:05:57.322
You heard me. Nothing!
There is no secret ingredient!

00:05:57.452 --> 00:06:00.542
Wait, wait.
It's just plain old noodle soup?

00:06:00.673 --> 00:06:02.849
You don't add some kind of
special sauce or something?

00:06:02.979 --> 00:06:08.159
Don't have to.
To make something special,
you just believe it's special.

00:06:18.734 --> 00:06:21.346
There is no secret ingredient.

00:06:27.352 --> 00:06:29.354
[thunderclap]

00:06:30.181 --> 00:06:31.878
[thunder rumbling]

